WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.712
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.795 --> 00:05.296
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.380 --> 00:06.881
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.965 --> 00:08.466
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.550 --> 00:11.553
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.636 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.765
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.849 --> 00:17.517
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.600 --> 00:19.352
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.690
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.773 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.735
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.818 --> 00:28.278
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.361 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.658
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.742 --> 00:37.203
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:03.062 --> 01:07.400
Price check on industrial size
econo-pack of raw fiber.
工业规模价格检查
原纤维经济包装。

01:07.484 --> 01:10.069
It goes in like steel wool
它像钢丝绒一样插入

01:10.153 --> 01:12.447
but comes out like
an angel from heaven.
但结果就像
来自天堂的天使。

01:12.530 --> 01:14.115
Please, tell me more.
请告诉我更多。

01:14.199 --> 01:15.909
Ooh, well,
this one time...
哦，好吧，
这一次...

01:15.992 --> 01:17.368
Not really.
并不真地。

01:17.452 --> 01:18.912
I didn't think so.
我不这么认为。

01:18.995 --> 01:20.872
Oh, wait, I almost
forgot me coupons.
哦，等等，我几乎
忘记给我优惠券了。

01:20.955 --> 01:22.874
There's a couple double
ones in there, too.
有一对双人的
那里也有。

01:22.957 --> 01:25.585
Sir, these expired
over 30 years ago.
先生，这些已经过期了
30多年前。

01:25.668 --> 01:26.795
What does that mean?
这意味着什么？

01:26.878 --> 01:28.588
It means they're not good.
这说明他们不好。

01:28.671 --> 01:29.756
Sir, I'll just throw
those away for you.
先生，我就扔
那些为你而远去的人。

01:29.839 --> 01:32.509
No, wait, I'll take 'em.
不，等等，我会接受他们。

01:33.843 --> 01:35.261
OK, sir, your change today
好的，先生，您今天换了

01:35.345 --> 01:37.388
is going to be exactly 10 cents.
正好是 10 美分。

01:37.472 --> 01:41.518
Come to papa,
come to papa.
来到爸爸身边，
来找爸爸吧。

01:41.601 --> 01:43.520
Hooray!
万岁！

01:43.603 --> 01:45.605
Two Nickels.
两枚镍币。

01:47.482 --> 01:49.400
Hey, that's SpongeBob out there.
嘿，那是海绵宝宝。

01:53.196 --> 01:55.198
What in blue blazes
is that boy up to?
蓝色火焰里有什么
那个男孩在做什么？

02:06.084 --> 02:08.378
Well, I'll be
a geriatric jellyfish.
嗯，我会的
一种老年水母。

02:08.461 --> 02:10.129
SpongeBob found a penny.
海绵宝宝找到了一分钱。

02:10.213 --> 02:13.341
A bright, shiny penny
just sitting there
一枚明亮闪亮的便士
就坐在那里

02:13.424 --> 02:14.926
and he picked it right up.
他马上把它捡了起来。

02:15.009 --> 02:17.178
I can remember
the whole thing
我记得
整个事情

02:17.262 --> 02:18.847
as if it had just
happened a moment ago.
就好像它刚刚
发生在刚才。

02:33.236 --> 02:35.738
Sir,  sir?
先生，先生？

02:35.822 --> 02:38.283
Sir?
先生？

02:38.366 --> 02:39.576
You're holding
up the line.
你拿着
上线。

02:39.659 --> 02:40.702
Oh, I am?
哦，我是？

02:40.785 --> 02:42.745
Next, please.
接下来请。

02:42.829 --> 02:46.207
Interesting how things
work out that way.
有趣的是事情如何
就这样锻炼吧。

02:46.291 --> 02:49.669
Some folks just walk along
and stumble over free money
有些人只是走着走着
并偶然发现了免费的钱

02:49.752 --> 02:51.921
while others...
Others, they work.
而其他人...
其他人，他们工作。

02:52.005 --> 02:53.590
Hey, Mommy, look
at that weird guy
嘿，妈妈，你看
在那个奇怪的家伙

02:53.673 --> 02:55.884
in the car over there.
在那边的车里。

02:55.967 --> 02:58.219
Billy, mommy's watching
the road right now.
比利，妈妈在看着
现在的路。

02:58.303 --> 03:01.556
I mean, why couldn't  I  have
just walked along and found it?
我的意思是，为什么我不能
刚刚走过去就发现了？

03:01.639 --> 03:04.017
I have legs too, you know.
我也有腿，你知道的。

03:04.100 --> 03:05.351
: Ooh.
：哦。

03:05.435 --> 03:07.270
How 'bout a little music?
来点音乐怎么样？

03:08.563 --> 03:09.898
: Oh, wha!
：哦，哇！

03:09.981 --> 03:12.358
OK, OK, get a grip, Krabs.
好吧，好吧，抓紧，蟹蟹。

03:12.442 --> 03:14.360
Just concentrate on driving.
专心驾驶即可。

03:15.987 --> 03:17.030
Ah!
啊!

03:19.157 --> 03:20.992
OK.
好的。

03:21.075 --> 03:23.953
Getting all worked up
over one little coin.
全力以赴
超过一枚小硬币。

03:25.538 --> 03:29.042
Ah, must just be the full moon.
啊，一定是满月吧。

03:29.125 --> 03:30.668
Wait a second.
等一下。

03:35.423 --> 03:36.883
I gotta
我必须

03:36.966 --> 03:38.384
have that
有那个

03:38.468 --> 03:40.011
penny!
一分钱！

03:44.474 --> 03:46.267
Good morning, SpongeBob.
早上好，海绵宝宝。

03:46.351 --> 03:47.727
Good morning, Mr. Krabs.
早上好，蟹老板。

03:47.810 --> 03:49.479
Find anything
special, lately?
找到任何东西
最近，特别吗？

03:49.562 --> 03:50.688
Yeah-yes.
是的，是的。

03:50.772 --> 03:52.273
Really?
真的吗？

03:52.357 --> 03:53.900
And you want to share it
并且你想分享它

03:53.983 --> 03:56.694
with your old Uncle Krabs,
don't you, boy?
和你的老螃蟹叔叔，
你不是吗，孩子？

03:56.778 --> 03:58.071
Of course.
当然。

03:58.154 --> 03:59.322
Great.
伟大的。

03:59.405 --> 04:01.950
Well, share it with me.
嗯，和我分享一下吧。

04:03.451 --> 04:05.244
I already am sharing
it with you, Mr. Krabs.
我已经在分享了
蟹老板，和你一起吧。

04:05.328 --> 04:06.621
What?
什么？

04:06.704 --> 04:08.498
The thing I found
我发现的东西

04:08.581 --> 04:10.375
was a bright, shiny
是明亮的、有光泽的

04:10.458 --> 04:12.418
new day!
新的一天！

04:12.502 --> 04:14.754
Well, I'll be in the
kitchen if you need me.
嗯，我会在
厨房，如果你需要我的话。

04:14.837 --> 04:16.089
SpongeBob:
Morning, Squidward.
海绵宝宝：
早上好，章鱼哥。

04:16.172 --> 04:17.757
Don't talk to me.
别跟我说话。

04:17.840 --> 04:18.925
Mr. Krabs seems to be
in a good mood today.
蟹老板先生好像是
今天心情很好。

04:19.008 --> 04:20.093
That counts as talking.
这才算说话。

04:22.011 --> 04:24.180
Whoa, hello again,
Mr. Krabs.
哇，又好，
蟹老板。

04:24.263 --> 04:25.515
Hello, SpongeBob.
你好，海绵宝宝。

04:25.598 --> 04:27.016
What can I do you for?
我能为你做什么？

04:27.100 --> 04:29.018
Can I borrow
a penny?
我可以借吗
一分钱？

04:29.102 --> 04:31.104
Sure.
当然。

04:31.187 --> 04:32.397
Hm, sorry.
嗯，抱歉。

04:32.480 --> 04:34.649
All out of pennies right now.
现在已经没钱了。

04:34.732 --> 04:36.234
But did you check
all your pockets?
但你检查过吗
你的口袋里都有吗？

04:36.317 --> 04:37.443
Well, I thought I did.
嗯，我想我做到了。

04:37.527 --> 04:38.653
Front pockets?
前袋？

04:38.736 --> 04:40.446
Hm, no.
嗯，不。

04:40.530 --> 04:42.699
Um-um.
嗯嗯。

04:42.782 --> 04:44.117
Nada.
没什么。

04:45.326 --> 04:46.786
Shoe pockets.
鞋袋。

04:46.869 --> 04:48.413
Oh, Mr. Krabs, that
is just ridiculous.
哦，蟹老板，那个
太荒谬了。

04:48.496 --> 04:49.956
It is?
这是？

04:50.039 --> 04:51.833
Oh, I do have
a tie pocket, though.
哦，我有
不过，还有一个领带口袋。

04:51.916 --> 04:53.751
No, not in there, either.
不，也不在那里。

04:53.835 --> 04:55.795
Hey, maybe it fell
in your sock.
嘿嘿，可能是掉下来了
在你的袜子里。

04:55.878 --> 04:57.380
Well, I...
嗯，我...

04:57.463 --> 04:58.548
:
It's just gotta
：
只是必须

04:58.631 --> 05:00.341
be in there somewhere
在那里某处

05:00.425 --> 05:01.968
to get, to get that...
得到，得到那个…

05:03.386 --> 05:05.555
Uh...
呃...

05:05.638 --> 05:06.723
It's my brain.
这是我的大脑。

05:08.766 --> 05:10.101
Hey, where's it going?
嘿，它要去哪儿？

05:11.602 --> 05:12.687
SpongeBob: Oh, there.
海绵宝宝：哦，在那里。

05:14.939 --> 05:17.108
SpongeBob: Look there,
look that way... There.
海绵宝宝：看那儿，
朝那个方向看……那里。

05:17.191 --> 05:18.693
Both: I got it.
两人：我明白了。

05:18.776 --> 05:20.236
SpongeBob: I got it,
I got it, I got it.
海绵宝宝：我明白了
我明白了，我明白了。

05:23.239 --> 05:24.198
Aha.
啊哈。

05:27.326 --> 05:28.286
Ugh.
啊。

05:29.912 --> 05:31.247
SpongeBob: Not so fast,
little guy.
海绵宝宝：没那么快，
小家伙。

05:31.330 --> 05:33.291
:
There you go...
：
就这样吧...

05:33.374 --> 05:34.459
...look, huh?
……你看，嗯？

05:34.542 --> 05:35.835
Yes, I know.
是的，我知道。

05:37.754 --> 05:39.839
Uh...
呃...

05:39.922 --> 05:42.175
Didn't you know
I was a brain whisperer?
你不知道吗
我是个脑语者？

05:42.258 --> 05:44.594
So, uh,
no penny, huh?
所以，呃，
没有一分钱吧？

05:44.677 --> 05:45.803
Darn.
该死。

05:51.059 --> 05:52.935
Squidward, these deafening
construction sounds
章鱼哥，这些震耳欲聋的
施工声音

05:53.019 --> 05:54.729
are preventing me from working.
妨碍我工作。

05:54.812 --> 05:56.355
Me too.
我也是。

05:56.439 --> 05:58.524
You think we should walk
out back to investigate?
你认为我们应该步行
回去调查？

05:58.608 --> 06:00.234
Never.
绝不。

06:00.318 --> 06:01.736
SpongeBob: The sounds were
coming from back here.
海绵宝宝：声音是
从这里回来。

06:01.819 --> 06:03.029
What the!
什么啊！

06:04.280 --> 06:06.532
Careful with
those marquee letters.
小心
那些字幕字母。

06:06.616 --> 06:09.869
Hey, Mr. Krabs, you made
your own movie theater.
嘿，蟹老板，你做了
你自己的电影院。

06:09.952 --> 06:11.871
Yes, I did.
是的，我做到了。

06:11.954 --> 06:14.373
And you're just in time
for the grand opening.
而你来得正是时候
为盛大开幕。

06:19.462 --> 06:21.172
Step right up, folks.
站起来，伙计们。

06:21.255 --> 06:24.509
And witness a spellbinding tale
chockful of adventure.
见证一个引人入胜的故事
充满冒险。

06:24.592 --> 06:26.177
And action...
还有行动...

06:26.260 --> 06:27.929
And thrills.
和刺激。

06:28.012 --> 06:30.306
You know, I'm not
really hungry.
你知道，我不是
真的很饿。

06:30.389 --> 06:32.850
Yeah, let's go see what this
fat guy is yelling about.
是啊，我们去看看这是什么
胖子正在大喊大叫。

06:32.934 --> 06:34.644
Witness the
terrifying challenges
见证
可怕的挑战

06:34.727 --> 06:38.064
overcome by, by...
克服, 被...

06:38.147 --> 06:39.232
By who?
由谁来？

06:39.315 --> 06:40.775
By, uh...
靠，呃...

06:40.858 --> 06:43.653
By a plucky
young sponge.
由一个勇敢的
年轻的海绵。

06:43.736 --> 06:44.737
Just like me.
就像我一样。

06:44.821 --> 06:46.405
That's right.
这是正确的。

06:46.489 --> 06:47.782
And the best part Is
最好的部分是

06:47.865 --> 06:50.868
admission is only
one penny.
入场仅
一分钱。

06:50.952 --> 06:53.329
Does a movie
like that even exist?
拍电影吗
这样的事还存在吗？

06:53.412 --> 06:55.164
Yeah, does it?
是啊，是吗？

06:55.248 --> 06:59.252
Um... Well, actually, I was
gonna show you this flip book.
嗯...好吧，实际上，我是
给你看这本翻书。

06:59.335 --> 07:00.795
A flip book.
一本翻书。

07:00.878 --> 07:02.880
Yeah, I don't even
know what that  is!
是的，我什至不
知道那是什么！

07:02.964 --> 07:06.592
No, wait...
不，等等...

07:06.676 --> 07:08.761
No!
不！

07:08.845 --> 07:11.389
Mr. Krabs, can I see
the movie now...
蟹老板，我可以看看吗
电影现在...

07:11.472 --> 07:12.890
Please?
请？

07:12.974 --> 07:14.725
Of course, you can, lad.
当然，你可以，小伙子。

07:16.060 --> 07:17.645
You just gotta
give me one penny.
你只需要
给我一分钱。

07:17.728 --> 07:19.438
But, but...
但是，但是……

07:19.522 --> 07:22.608
But... I really
don't  have  a penny.
但是……我真的
一分钱都没有。

07:36.873 --> 07:38.291
Oh, that's too bad.
哦，那太糟糕了。

07:38.374 --> 07:39.750
I really wanted
to see that movie.
我真的很想要
看那部电影。

07:39.834 --> 07:40.960
Oh, well.
那好吧。

07:41.043 --> 07:42.295
Good evening.
晚上好。

07:43.546 --> 07:46.382
And... welcome to the...
并且...欢迎来到...

07:46.465 --> 07:49.635
Krusty Krab Semi-Annual
Charity Night.
蟹堡王半年刊
慈善之夜。

07:49.719 --> 07:50.803
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

07:50.887 --> 07:52.513
You look beautiful.
你看起来很漂亮。

07:52.597 --> 07:55.391
: Let me show
you to your table.
: 让我展示一下
你到你的桌子上。

07:55.474 --> 07:56.976
My table?
我的桌子？

07:57.059 --> 07:58.519
Whoa, fancy.
哇，太棒了。

07:59.812 --> 08:01.856
My very own name tag.
我自己的名牌。

08:06.569 --> 08:09.822
Hello, and welcome to
a very important evening.
您好，欢迎来到
一个非常重要的夜晚。

08:09.906 --> 08:11.199
Tonight's evening is entitled:
今晚的题目是：

08:11.282 --> 08:14.410
"Pennies for the Penniless."
“给身无分文的人提供便士。”

08:14.493 --> 08:16.037
And before the following
images are shown
以及在以下内容之前
显示图像

08:16.120 --> 08:17.788
I would ask each of you
我会问你们每个人

08:17.872 --> 08:20.541
to look not with your eyes
不用眼睛看

08:20.625 --> 08:23.753
but with your heart.
但用你的心。

08:23.836 --> 08:27.006
Krabs: Three dimes.
蟹蟹：三毛钱。

08:27.089 --> 08:29.592
Two Nickels.
两枚镍币。

08:29.675 --> 08:33.012
One quarter.
四分之一。

08:33.095 --> 08:35.973
Zero pennies.
零便士。

08:38.768 --> 08:40.102
And since I realize
the images seen here tonight
自从我意识到
今晚在这里看到的图像

08:40.186 --> 08:42.480
may be wretchedly hideous
可能非常丑陋

08:42.563 --> 08:46.901
I am going to tell you what you
can do to end this travesty.
我要告诉你什么
可以做些什么来结束这种嘲讽。

08:46.984 --> 08:51.822
You can donate one penny
to me, Mr. Krabs.
你可以捐一分钱
对我来说，蟹老板。

08:51.906 --> 08:55.368
Also known as Mr. Krabs,
the man who doesn't have one.
也被称为蟹老板，
一个没有的人。

08:59.455 --> 09:00.539
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

09:00.623 --> 09:01.999
Yes?
是的？

09:02.083 --> 09:03.918
I would like to donate a penny.
我愿意捐一分钱。

09:04.001 --> 09:05.586
You would?
你会吗？

09:05.670 --> 09:07.380
If I only had one.
如果我只有一个就好了。

09:18.975 --> 09:20.685
Penny, got to...
佩妮，必须...

09:20.768 --> 09:23.354
... Penny.
……佩妮。

09:23.437 --> 09:25.731
Not gonna...
不会...

09:26.816 --> 09:27.942
Ha-ha.
哈哈。

09:33.406 --> 09:34.448
Ahh!
啊！

09:38.661 --> 09:40.579
Krabs: Hee-hee-hee-hee...
螃蟹：嘿嘿嘿嘿……

09:40.663 --> 09:41.664
Now we...
现在我们...

09:50.881 --> 09:52.591
Hiding it...
隐藏它...

09:52.675 --> 09:54.552
Somewhere.
某处。

09:56.762 --> 09:57.638
Hiding it.
隐藏它。

10:00.057 --> 10:01.851
Hiding it.
隐藏它。

10:01.934 --> 10:04.603
Hiding... it.
隐藏……它。

10:04.687 --> 10:07.356
Hiding it?
隐藏它？

10:07.440 --> 10:08.441
Meow.
喵。

10:08.524 --> 10:09.608
What's that?
那是什么？

