10:36.552 --> 10:37.928
SpongeBob, I...
海绵宝宝，我...

10:38.012 --> 10:40.306
I... I, I just
wanted that penny
我...我我只是
想要那一分钱

10:40.389 --> 10:43.059
you found on the
street, yesterday.
你发现在
街道，昨天。

10:43.142 --> 10:46.187
Oh, I'm sorry.
哦，对不起。

10:46.270 --> 10:50.608
Mr. Krabs, that wasn't
a penny  .
蟹老板，那不是
一分钱。

10:50.691 --> 10:53.319
It wasn't?
