11:02.078 --> 11:06.123
I feel so relieved.
我感觉很轻松。

11:06.207 --> 11:09.126
There was no penny after all.
终究是没有一分钱。

11:09.210 --> 11:12.463
Ah, well, I'll be going now.
啊，好吧，我现在就走了。

11:12.546 --> 11:14.673
You can keep the metal
detector, SpongeBob- see ya.
你可以保留金属
探测器，海绵宝宝——再见。

11:14.757 --> 11:16.425
Thanks, Mr. Krabs.
谢谢，蟹老板。

11:16.509 --> 11:17.843
Here, Gary, you
can play with that.
在这里，加里，你
可以玩那个。

11:23.057 --> 11:25.893
Hey, this isn't gum at all.
