11:57.883 --> 12:01.303
You now see the importance
of proper steering
你现在明白了重要性
正确的转向

12:01.387 --> 12:02.513
And a properly
calibrated anchor.
以及一个正确的
校准锚。

12:07.309 --> 12:09.145
Which brings us
to the subject of
这给我们带来了
to the subject of

