Barnacles, just as we were
getting to the nitty-gritty.
藤壶，就像我们一样
进入实质内容。

12:16.652 --> 12:17.570
Wait a minute.
等一下。

12:22.158 --> 12:23.826
Remember, we will
not be here tomorrow.
请记住，我们会
明天不在这里。

