17:57.659 --> 17:59.745
And that's fancy-fancy talk for
这就是花哨的谈话

17:59.828 --> 18:02.080
let's get this party started...
让我们开始这个聚会吧...

18:02.164 --> 18:03.874
Like instantly.
就像瞬间一样。

18:06.001 --> 18:07.461
Deh-deh-deh, deh-deh, dah.
