19:50.606 --> 19:51.690
Then...
然后...

19:51.773 --> 19:53.275
I know what to do.
我知道该怎么做。

19:53.358 --> 19:54.860
I read a book.
我读了一本书。

19:54.943 --> 19:56.612
Chapter One:
"Batten Down the Hatches."
第一章：
“把舱门封好。”

19:58.530 --> 19:59.948
Next, lower anchor.
接下来，下锚。

20:02.951 --> 20:05.037
No, the anchor's stuck.
不，锚被卡住了。

20:05.120 --> 20:06.580
I'm going to have
to free it manually.
我将会有
手动释放它。

20:06.663 --> 20:08.040
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

20:15.130 --> 20:16.006
Doh!
哎哟！

20:20.719 --> 20:23.180
Done and done.
完成了，完成了。

20:23.263 --> 20:26.308
Thirdly: "Utter a hearty
seaman's laugh".
第三：“发自内心的
海员的笑声”。

20:27.768 --> 20:29.603
Oh, my gravy.
哦，我的肉汁。

20:29.686 --> 20:31.647
He even knows the hearty laugh.
他甚至还知道爽朗的笑声。

20:31.730 --> 20:33.357
He  has  been doing his homework.
他一直在做作业。

20:35.692 --> 20:37.903
And finally,
the  coup de grace.
最后，
致命一击。

20:37.986 --> 20:41.865
The only way to park
the largest ship ever built
停车的唯一途径
有史以来建造的最大的船

20:41.949 --> 20:44.493
is by performing the reverse
seven/20 tailspin.
是通过执行相反的操作
七/20 混乱。

20:46.203 --> 20:48.497
But that's never even
been attempted before.
但这从来都不是
之前已经尝试过。

20:48.580 --> 20:50.165
You're right, it hasn't.
你说得对，还没有。

20:50.249 --> 20:51.250
Not until now.
直到现在。

21:10.143 --> 21:12.229
SpongeBob, I don't know how
海绵宝宝，我不知道怎么办

21:12.312 --> 21:13.897
but you did it.
但你做到了。

21:13.981 --> 21:15.941
You saved us all.
你拯救了我们所有人。

21:16.024 --> 21:18.193
Mrs. Puff: Oh, let's
get off this thing.
泡芙夫人：哦，我们来吧
摆脱这件事。

21:18.276 --> 21:21.905
And the way you pulled the
anchor out...  genius.
还有你拉的方式
锚定...天才。

21:21.989 --> 21:24.783
I never thought
I'd say this but...
我从没想过
我想说这个但是...

21:24.866 --> 21:27.536
here's your driver's license.
这是你的驾驶执照。

21:33.417 --> 21:34.626
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

21:34.710 --> 21:36.920
At long last.
终于。

21:37.004 --> 21:38.046
Man: What are you
two doing here?
男：你是什么东西
两个人在这里做什么？

21:39.381 --> 21:40.549
Huh?
啊？

21:40.632 --> 21:42.092
No one should be on board
船上不应有人

21:42.175 --> 21:43.969
while I'm tugging
the museum into port.
当我拉扯的时候
博物馆进入港口。

21:44.052 --> 21:46.013
You mean, he wasn't
driving this thing at all?
你的意思是，他不是
驾驶这东西吗？

21:46.096 --> 21:46.972
Heck, no.
哎呀，不。

21:54.896 --> 21:56.815
Now, don't get
so down, kid.
现在，不要得到
这么沮丧，孩子。

21:56.898 --> 21:59.317
Look, for your false bravery
看吧，看看你虚假的勇敢

21:59.401 --> 22:02.779
I'm giving you your
honorary sea legs, OK?
我给你你的
荣誉海腿，好吗？

22:02.863 --> 22:05.282
Come on, let me buy
you an ice cream.
来吧，让我买
你一个冰淇淋。

22:08.744 --> 22:11.580
Oh, gosh...
Headlights are on.
哦，天哪...
车头灯亮了。

22:11.663 --> 22:13.749
Both: Don't touch
anything, you twit!
两人：别碰
什么都行，你这个混蛋！

22:16.710 --> 22:18.253
Run!
跑步！

22:24.009 --> 22:27.220
Good thing you studied.
还好你学了。

还好你学了。